msgid "F407 多通道 PWM、单脉冲与 DMA 序列"
msgstr "F407 multi-channel PWM, one-pulse operation and DMA sequences"

msgid "这里记录 STM32F407VE／ZG 的单一 timer owner 软件合同。寄存器、原生 DMA 访问宽度和 ITR 表来自 RM0090 Rev22，复用引脚来自 DS8626 Rev12。静态软件参考 不代表电机、电源级、外部连线、PCB 修订或物理波形已经验证。"
msgstr "This page records the single timer owner software contract for STM32F407VE/ZG. Registers, native DMA access widths and ITR tables come from RM0090 Rev22; alternate-function pins come from DS8626 Rev12. Static software references do not establish validation of motors, power stages, external wiring, PCB revisions or physical waveforms."

msgid "箭头区分配置、调用和借用。每个物理 timer 只选择一个 face：`pwm_group`、 `timer_pulse` 或 `timer_sequence`；不能同时选择另一种 PWM、encoder、capture 或 advanced PWM owner。没有第二套 open、运行时注册表、默认 buffer pool、heap 或 后台 worker。factory 只返回已存在的对象，prepare 不启动 counter、通道或 DMA。 Platform close 必须排空同一个 owner，失败会阻止 System 退出并保留完整借用。"
msgstr "Arrows distinguish configuration, calls and borrowing. Each physical timer selects exactly one face: `pwm_group`, `timer_pulse` or `timer_sequence`. It cannot simultaneously select another PWM, encoder, capture or advanced PWM owner. There is no second open path, runtime registry, default buffer pool, heap or background worker. Factory lookup returns existing objects only; prepare starts no counter, channel or DMA. Platform close must drain that same owner. Failure prevents System withdrawal and retains all borrows."

msgid "实例与硬件边界"
msgstr "Instances and hardware boundaries"

msgid "实例"
msgstr "Instance"

msgid "计数／输出能力"
msgstr "Counter/output capabilities"

msgid "本软件可选模式"
msgstr "Modes selectable by this software"

msgid "TIM1、TIM8"
msgstr "TIM1、TIM8"

msgid "16-bit，四个主通道，前三个互补输出，BKIN／deadtime，TRGO／slave，UPDATE DMA"
msgstr "16-bit, four main channels, complementary outputs on the first three, BKIN/deadtime, TRGO/slave, UPDATE DMA"

msgid "group、pulse、sequence；group 可选择互补及内部 CH4 trigger"
msgstr "group, pulse, sequence; group may select complementary outputs and an internal CH4 trigger"

msgid "TIM3、TIM4"
msgstr "TIM3、TIM4"

msgid "16-bit，四个通道，TRGO／slave，UPDATE DMA"
msgstr "16-bit, four channels, TRGO/slave, UPDATE DMA"

msgid "group、pulse、sequence"
msgstr "group、pulse、sequence"

msgid "TIM5"
msgstr "TIM5"

msgid "32-bit，四个通道，TRGO／slave，UPDATE DMA"
msgstr "32-bit, four channels, TRGO/slave, UPDATE DMA"

msgid "CPU group／pulse 保留 32-bit；sequence 的 DMAR native item 为 16-bit"
msgstr "CPU group/pulse retain 32-bit operation; a sequence DMAR native item is 16-bit"

msgid "TIM9、TIM12"
msgstr "TIM9、TIM12"

msgid "16-bit，两个通道，slave；没有 TRGO master 或 DMA burst"
msgstr "16-bit, two channels, slave; no TRGO master or DMA burst"

msgid "两通道 group、单／双通道 pulse"
msgstr "Two-channel group; single/dual-channel pulse"

msgid "TIM10、TIM11、TIM13、TIM14"
msgstr "TIM10、TIM11、TIM13、TIM14"

msgid "16-bit，一个通道；没有 slave／master 或 DMA burst"
msgstr "16-bit, one channel; no slave/master or DMA burst"

msgid "单通道 pulse；普通连续单通道 PWM 沿用原 `pwm` face"
msgstr "Single-channel pulse; ordinary continuous single-channel PWM retains the existing `pwm` face"

msgid "TIM6、TIM7"
msgstr "TIM6、TIM7"

msgid "没有 PWM 输出通道"
msgstr "No PWM output channels"

msgid "不作为输出缺口；基础 timer／DAC 触发属于其原有 owner"
msgstr "Not an output-coverage gap; basic timers/DAC triggers belong to their existing owners"

msgid "TIM2"
msgstr "TIM2"

msgid "Core 的单调时间基准"
msgstr "Core monotonic timebase"

msgid "保留给 System，所有新波形选择拒绝"
msgstr "Reserved for System; all new waveform selections reject"

msgid "新 waveform owner 的 TIM1 与 TIM9、TIM8 与 TIM12 可以独立装配。TIM9／12 不启用 IRQ，也不修改相应的共享 NVIC；停止它们只撤回自身 timer。旧 `complementary-pwm` cold owner 仍通过 mode resources 保留对应 peer fence， 它原有的共享 vector 和 peer 门钟准入检查保持生效。"
msgstr "The new waveform owner permits independent assembly of TIM1 alongside TIM9 and TIM8 alongside TIM12. TIM9/12 enable no IRQs and do not modify their shared NVIC; stopping them withdraws only their own timer. The existing `complementary-pwm` cold owner still retains its corresponding peer fence through mode resources. Its existing shared-vector and peer-clock-gate admission checks remain in effect."

msgid "counter 时钟取配置期统一的 APB timer domain，不能从 APB bus 时钟直接猜出。 `tick_hz` 必须精确整除源时钟，PSC 为 0…65535。CPU 组固定 period，比较值包含 零及完整 period；普通 16-bit 参考的 period 上限为 65535 ticks，TIM5 CPU 模式可 用 32-bit period。deadtime 取未经过 PSC 的 tDTS ticks，只接受 DTG 的精确编码， 不向上或向下舍入保护时间。"
msgstr "The counter clock comes from the unified configuration-time APB timer domain and must not be guessed from the APB bus clock. `tick_hz` must divide the source clock exactly; PSC is 0…65535. CPU groups use a fixed period, with compare values including zero and the full period. Ordinary 16-bit references allow a period up to 65535 ticks; TIM5 CPU mode supports a 32-bit period. Deadtime uses tDTS ticks before PSC and accepts only exact DTG encodings, without rounding protection time up or down."

msgid "CPU 组提交与 break"
msgstr "CPU group commit and break"

msgid "应用一次给出按通道升序排列的完整 duty 数组，互补 group 另给内部 CH4 trigger。 owner 先验证整个输入，再设置并回读 UDIS，然后写全部 CCR shadows。全部成功才 解除 UDIS，因而中间硬件 update 不能发布部分新组。成功仅表示一组一致的 shadow 已经就绪，不表示该 update 已发生。方法返回后不保留 frame 或数组指针。 这些原子更新及带真实回读的最终排空属于现有 HAL／LL 单次寄存器 setter 之外的 所有权合同，因此由手写 C 直接控制；官方寄存器类型始终留在私有实现。"
msgstr "The application supplies a complete duty array in ascending channel order in one call; a complementary group also supplies an internal CH4 trigger. The owner validates the entire input, sets and reads back UDIS, then writes all CCR shadows. It clears UDIS only after every step succeeds, so an intermediate hardware update cannot publish a partial new group. Success means only that one consistent shadow group is ready, not that its update has occurred. No frame or array pointer is retained after the method returns. These atomic updates and final drain with actual readback are ownership contracts beyond individual HAL/LL register setters, so handwritten C controls them directly. Official register types remain private."

msgid "TIM1／8 与既有 advanced PWM 复用同一个 break、deadtime 和输出撤回核心。 BKIN 或 BIF 先锁存 fault、撤销 MOE，再确认标志；不启用 AOE 或 lock。部分 CCR 写入失败会撤回输出并保留 fault，不能把混合 shadow 释放给下一次 update。 应用必须重新提交完整组，在输出关闭且 BKIN 不活动时显式 clear fault，随后另行 start；clear 不自动启动。声明的 GPIO idle 电平只描述软件管脚状态，不能证明 外部功率电路安全。"
msgstr "TIM1/8 reuse the same break, deadtime and output-withdrawal core as existing advanced PWM. BKIN or BIF first latches the fault and withdraws MOE, then acknowledges the flag; AOE and lock are not enabled. A partial CCR write failure withdraws outputs and retains the fault; mixed shadows must not be released to the next update. The application must resubmit the complete group, explicitly clear the fault while outputs are off and BKIN is inactive, then start separately. Clearing does not start automatically. Declared GPIO idle levels describe software pin states only and do not establish external power-circuit safety."

msgid "硬件单脉冲"
msgstr "Hardware one-pulse operation"

msgid "`timer_pulse` 借用 request 和完整只读 width 数组。width 范围为零到 period−1， 硬件使用 PWM2，领先的 period−width ticks 为不活动电平，所有通道在同一个 OPM 周期结束。零宽度始终不活动；完整 period 的活动电平没有不活动尾部，因此拒绝。 OPM 在硬件 update 时清除 CEN，不需要每通道 ISR，也不依赖任务及时停机。"
msgstr "`timer_pulse` borrows the request and the complete read-only width array. Width ranges from zero to period−1. Hardware uses PWM2, with the leading period−width ticks inactive; all channels finish in the same OPM period. Zero width remains inactive throughout. A full period of active output has no inactive tail and is therefore rejected. OPM clears CEN on the hardware update, requiring neither a per-channel ISR nor timely task shutdown."

msgid "owner 在启动前清除并回读 UIF。很短的脉冲可能在 CEN 写回读前已经结束，这时只有 来自本次启动的新 UIF 加 CEN=0 才能接受完成。成功还必须撤回通道、定时器源及 真实 break IRQ，才发布 SETTLED 和一个完成周期。取消／错误报告零保证周期。 截止包括最后排空；先看到计数结束、随后 IRQ 在截止之后才退出，仍报告超时。"
msgstr "The owner clears and reads back UIF before starting. A very short pulse may finish before the CEN write is read back; completion then requires a fresh UIF from this start together with CEN=0. Success also requires withdrawal of channels, timer sources and the actual break IRQ before publishing SETTLED and one completed period. Cancellation/errors report zero guaranteed periods. The deadline includes final drain: if counting ends first but the IRQ exits after the deadline, the result is still timeout."

msgid "TRGO 与 ITR 同步"
msgstr "TRGO and ITR synchronization"

msgid "TOML 显式选择 master 的 `enable`、`update` 或内部 `oc4ref`，slave 则给出源实例 与 `reset`、`gated` 或 `trigger`。配置期按 RM0090 的每实例 ITR 表解析，拒绝假 连接、非 TRGO 的 OC 别名、未选源和循环依赖。TIM2 不成为新输出 master。"
msgstr "TOML explicitly selects master `enable`, `update` or internal `oc4ref`; a slave declares its source instance and `reset`, `gated` or `trigger`. Configuration resolves each instance through its RM0090 ITR table, rejecting nonexistent connections, OC aliases that are not TRGO, unselected sources and cyclic dependencies. TIM2 cannot become a new output master."

msgid "prepare 与 start 的软件 UG 周围暂用 MMS=ENABLE 且 CEN=0，使 TRGO 保持低； MMS=RESET 的 UG 本身会输出 TRGO，不能用它当静音模式。全部 shadow、输出和 break 保护就绪后才设置选定 MMS／SMS。trigger slave 只 arm SMS，不由 CPU 置 CEN，实际 ITR 上升沿启动计数。reset 和 gated 使用硬件对应语义。stop 先撤回 slave SMS，再停输出和 counter，最后把 master TRGO 置于关闭 counter 的静音态。"
msgstr "Prepare and start temporarily use MMS=ENABLE with CEN=0 around software UG to keep TRGO low. UG with MMS=RESET itself produces TRGO and cannot serve as a quiet mode. The selected MMS/SMS are installed only after all shadows, outputs and break protection are ready. A trigger slave arms SMS only; the CPU does not set CEN. The actual ITR rising edge starts counting. Reset and gated use their corresponding hardware semantics. Stop first withdraws slave SMS, then stops outputs and the counter, and finally places master TRGO in the quiet state with the counter off."

msgid "应用先提交／启动全部 slave，再启动选定 master。有限 pulse 从接受到 SETTLED 期间，master 只提供一次启动事件，不能在 OPM 清 CEN 与任务观察之间重触发。 同步合同针对 counter／硬件触发，不把普通 PWM1 的静止初始输出电平解释成外部 电气边沿同步资格。gated 或 reset 会改变实际持续时间；应用应据此选择 deadline。"
msgstr "The application commits/starts every slave before starting the selected master. From finite pulse acceptance through SETTLED, the master supplies only one start event and must not retrigger between OPM clearing CEN and task observation. Synchronization applies to counters/hardware triggers; the static initial output level of ordinary PWM1 does not establish external electrical-edge synchronization qualification. Gated or reset changes the actual duration; the application must choose its deadline accordingly."

msgid "持续 UPDATE DMA 的有限序列"
msgstr "Finite sequences driven by continuous UPDATE DMA"

msgid "`timer_sequence` 使用普通 normal DMA，UPDATE 请求持续驱动 DMAR，不需要每行 service。应用提供已有 frame consumer loan：一个 plane、offset=0、连续 rows， row_bytes=stride=六个 native items，整份布局恰好等于 block.length。每行顺序固定： ARR、RCR／reserved-zero、CCR1、CCR2、CCR3、CCR4。未选择的 CCR 必须为零，RCR 必须为零，避免 repetition counter 或未实现寄存器语义改变帧边界。DMA 从 DBA=11 开始，每个 burst 六次传输（DBL 字段为 5），不能覆盖 BDTR、CCER 或 DIER。 TIM1／8 使用 native 32-bit，TIM3／4／5 使用 native 16-bit；TIM5 的 CPU counter 宽度不会改变它的 DMAR 访问宽度。"
msgstr "`timer_sequence` uses normal DMA; continuous UPDATE requests drive DMAR without per-row service. The application supplies an existing frame consumer loan: one plane, offset=0, contiguous rows, row_bytes=stride=six native items, and a complete layout exactly equal to block.length. Each row has a fixed order: ARR, RCR/reserved-zero, CCR1, CCR2, CCR3, CCR4. Unselected CCRs must be zero, and RCR must be zero, so repetition-counter or unimplemented-register semantics cannot alter frame boundaries. DMA starts at DBA=11, with six transfers per burst (DBL field 5), and cannot overwrite BDTR, CCER or DIER. TIM1/8 use native 32-bit items; TIM3/4/5 use native 16-bit items. TIM5 CPU counter width does not change its DMAR access width."

msgid "ARR+1 至少为配置的最短 period，所有 selected compare 都必须适合该行 period 和 native 存储。接收前有界扫描格式，接受后 DMA 直接读原存储，不逐行复制或 转换。总量不超过 65535 DMA items，所有实际 DMA 源字节须处于声明可达域，排除 CCM。整个 loan 的未用容量也属于借用，state 输出不能放进容量尾部或任何控制区。"
msgstr "ARR+1 must be at least the configured minimum period. Every selected compare must fit that row period and native storage. A bounded format scan precedes admission; after acceptance DMA reads the original storage directly, without per-row copying or conversion. The total is at most 65535 DMA items. Every actual DMA source byte must lie in the declared reachable domain, excluding CCM. Unused capacity of the entire loan is also borrowed; state output cannot occupy the capacity tail or any control region."

msgid "每个六项 burst 必须在下一次 update 前完成。`burst_budget_hclk_cycles` 是应用 声明并在实际并发负载下验证的上界，且必须严格小于最短 period 对应的 HCLK 周期。 软件没有测量或证明这个物理上界；超出条件可能在 update 时发布混合 shadows。 这条 DMA 合同不承诺任意总线阻塞下的跨 update 原子性或无间断波形。"
msgstr "Each six-item burst must finish before the next update. `burst_budget_hclk_cycles` is an application-declared upper bound validated under actual concurrent load, and must be strictly less than the HCLK cycles corresponding to the minimum period. Software neither measures nor proves this physical bound. Violating it may publish mixed shadows at an update. This DMA contract guarantees neither atomicity across updates under arbitrary bus stalls nor uninterrupted waveforms."

msgid "DMA TC／NDTR=0 只表示存储已经送入预装载寄存器。owner 先撤回 UDE、等待 DMA 总线 及真实 IRQ 退出，再清除并观察 UIF 的新边界，分别等待最后 shadow 生效及其后 完整尾周期。合并的旧 UIF 不代替这两次新观察。初始空闲周期及服务延迟期间的 尾行重复是显式合同；成功统计 DMA staged 的存储字节，不统计精确电脉冲次数。 最后关闭输出、解绑 DMA 两个地址及 PAR、恢复空闲配置，再归还 loan 并 SETTLED。"
msgstr "DMA TC/NDTR=0 means only that storage has reached preload registers. The owner first withdraws UDE and waits for the DMA bus and actual IRQ to exit, then clears and observes fresh UIF boundaries, separately waiting for the final shadow to take effect and for the full tail period afterward. Coalesced old UIF cannot replace these two fresh observations. The initial idle period and repetition of the final row during service latency are explicit contract terms. Success counts DMA-staged storage bytes, not exact electrical pulses. Finally, the owner closes outputs, detaches both DMA addresses and PAR, restores the idle configuration, then returns the loan and publishes SETTLED."

msgid "上下文、排空和软件证据"
msgstr "Context, drain and software evidence"

msgid "所有方法由同一个 privileged、非 ISR、未屏蔽的 task 串行调用，内部临界区保存 并恢复进入时的掩码。IRQ 只锁存真实所选源的事实，应用显式调用 service。 取消、错误或 deadline 不撤销借用；关闭 DMA、SMS、counter、GPIO 或真实 IRQ 的 任何回读失败都会保留 QUARANTINED 控制和整个源块。重新看起来像 reset 的寄存器 不能恢复丢失的 clock、DMA reset 或 System time epoch 历史。只允许复位已排空的 独占 TIM，绝不复位共享 DMA1／2。"
msgstr "The same privileged, non-ISR task calls every method serially with IRQs unmasked. Internal critical sections save and restore the incoming masks. IRQ only latches facts from the actual selected sources; the application explicitly calls service. Cancellation, errors and deadlines do not revoke borrows. Any failed readback while closing DMA, SMS, counter, GPIO or the actual IRQ retains QUARANTINED control storage and the entire source block. Registers that look reset again cannot recover lost clock, DMA reset or System time-epoch history. Only a drained, exclusively owned TIM may be reset; shared DMA1/2 are never reset."

msgid "维护程序 `tests/google/f407_timer_waveform_test.cpp` 直接编译生产 C11 后端，硬件 模型只提供 MMIO、IRQ、CPU 和时间边界；既有 `timer_advanced_test.cpp` 覆盖共享 break 核心回归。配置与真实 ARM 软件参考由 `tools/configure/test_f407_timer_waveform_configuration.py` 及对应 contract fixture 验证。软件通过不等于电气波形、DMA 并发吞吐或外部功率电路的 HIL 资格。"
msgstr "The maintained program `tests/google/f407_timer_waveform_test.cpp` directly compiles the production C11 backend. Hardware models supply only MMIO, IRQ, CPU and time boundaries; existing `timer_advanced_test.cpp` covers shared break-core regressions. `tools/configure/test_f407_timer_waveform_configuration.py` and the corresponding contract fixtures verify configuration and actual ARM software references. Passing software does not establish HIL qualification for electrical waveforms, concurrent DMA throughput or external power circuits."
